"h": "edf6ec18",
"en_raw": "Oh, it looks like it'll really rain"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "8d6f2d4b",
"en_raw": "Let's pack up for today"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "5ae4434a",
